      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>A short piyyut by Avraham Ibn Ezra, whose first name is signed in an acrostic. The translation here, from an unknown and anonymous contributor to zemirotdatabase.org, follows after the translation that Honi Sanders and I published in the birkon for his wedding, <tei:hi rend="italic">Siman l’Vanim</tei:hi> (Dimus Parrhesia Press 2019) with some minor changes. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
